    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ac76595d059c53dddb03c7f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……会有那种拯救世界的游戏吗？\n化身为圣女，与恶魔战斗之类的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7812a31087d0313df8ec598908ee5a3382d975aacf8cb3eff4c576bfe083c25",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/10/0010/storytimeline_100010002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e937bd2cd3611381155ee697",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迷人景致",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d00a4803d17b32d08d3d9ae9844b52810f0b4162c25dd8d8a1226ea163081d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/10/0010/storytimeline_100010002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de6963af2281acf0c646919e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哇，那和梦想酱很相配呢！但是我也不太擅长玩\n那种需要勾心斗角的游戏……没问题吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e86c3e1509f109499fcebc3da8f240f36ddb0d72600604937ab8acfaa7ce66a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/10/0010/storytimeline_100010002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21759bbfd082cdc15ca95709",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "统治地位",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec85cad9328ee0b111926357aac4c3a170b45eb8b28b57355bf49d22cf30ab46",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/10/0010/storytimeline_100010002.json",
