    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7be10b1bd3a012f195acd468",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "放心吧。桌游的涵盖范围可是极其广阔的。\n决定了，第二轮玩派对类游戏——",
      "source_fingerprint": "bae906d55c8721a03d4d7e55408ea0ba41c8ac4fd5406e416b016110b4a6a6e3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/10/0010/storytimeline_100010002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1cec1027be59d35e44428bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荣进闪耀",
      "source_fingerprint": "dddbabf0a14340be785a6989ad9c1b0d7af7714ae783df71e025920875aeeda6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/10/0010/storytimeline_100010002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ec7785c93ad4f67b03a22f9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不行。既然你打起精神来了，那就去赛道吧。\n该练习出闸了。我和玫瑰也会帮忙的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea68f6fca346425989ed71bbf93ae0be86d6221acf008648aa8b6c5f06192188",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
