      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那么，我就陪景致同学她们一起……。\n统治地位同学，有什么推荐的桌游吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc4d9bdb5d69c7437f88353fd2ba4a2b4d7d8d63cb2237e35a80f9ecde6a421f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
