    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81065911d0ce413730de7736",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的。我也写了『录音机』。\n为了就算去了远方，也不会忘记那珍贵的声音……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c2433ff97fe01fa3f6d487498af19c8e9e2bad2141baa2f848c72822090fed6",
