      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——进攻才是最好的防御。手牌要毫不吝啬地赐予部下。\n赌上蔷薇一族之名……为国家带来荣誉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fbc1459b007574f4657da6a2fcbeb87cd5080f40042e3a17fbb9c16d37d11aa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
