      "source_text": "那个，这种情况……应该是猜中了回答的我得分吧。\n小永同学，筹码我就收下咯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e7eac1f1c6a97fede590df3c759dd61de55c7763482307ff1c2538ca9fb12d4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
