      "source_text": "嘿，拿走吧～。……话说不妙，这游戏还挺好玩的。\n比萨，谢谢你也把我拉进来玩～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "913f8f0135ad41bf0712a7fe3756839b140d64cd1b9497a395e29ed75d756401",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
